{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"系统编程实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lock-free-data-structures","title":"无锁数据结构实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/lock-free-data-structures","wordCount":720,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"ffi-and-c-interop","title":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/ffi-and-c-interop","wordCount":605,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-profiling","title":"系统级性能分析与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/performance-profiling","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3}],"introMarkdown":"# 系统编程实战\n\n本章将前三章的理论知识落地为三个核心实战方向：无锁数据结构的实现、FFI 与 C 互操作的工程模式、以及系统级性能分析与调优。每篇文档都包含真实的生产级代码模式和可验证的性能数据。\n\n三个主题相互独立，可按兴趣选读。无锁编程综合运用了原子操作和内存序的知识；FFI 篇是内核开发和嵌入式中 C 绑定的工程化延伸；性能分析篇提供量化验证前三章所有优化决策的方法论。\n"}